<title>THAILAND: Nakornthon Bank Q3 net profit up 19.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Nakornthon Bank Q3 net profit up 19.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     1.50			1.42</p>
<p>    Net			186.57		    155.82</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     4.10     vs	     3.99</p>
<p>    Net			500.07     vs	   436.35</p>
<p>NOTES - Company's full name is Nakornthon Bank Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
